# Do you use any social networking sites?
Yes, I do. I use several social networking sites, such as Facebook, Instagram, and X, which used to be called Twitter. I mainly use them to keep in touch with my friends, especially those who live far away from me. I also occasionally use social media to catch up on what's happening in their lives or to watch interesting videos.

# Do you find yourself using more social network than you used to?
I have to say that I use social media more than I used to, mainly because it helps me with my work. Every day, I need to exchange ideas and communicate with colleagues who work in different departments. So, using messaging apps or social media platforms makes it much easier for us to stay in touch and discuss things quickly.